          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p The original definition is in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%D0%9B.+%D0%A1.+%D0%9F%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%BD"}> Л. С. Понтрягин
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Характеристические циклы многообразий
              %p
                English translation:
                = succeed "." do
                  %em Characteristic Cycles of Manifolds
                = succeed "." do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1201/9780367813758"} doi
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%D0%9B.+%D0%A1.+%D0%9F%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%BD"}> Л. С. Понтрягин
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Характеристические циклы дифференцируемых многообразий
                = succeed "." do
                  %a{:href => "http://mi.mathnet.ru/msb6237"} MathNet.Ru PDF
              %p
                English translation by A. A. Brown:
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lev+Pontrjagin"} Lev Pontrjagin
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Characteristic cycles on differentiable manifolds
                = succeed "." do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/papers/pont4.pdf"} PDF
                = succeed "." do
                  %em Characteristic Cycles of Differentiable Manifolds
                = succeed "." do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1201/9780367813758"} doi
          %p Early accounts:
          %ul
            %li#Hirzebruch56
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Hirzebruch"}> Friedrich Hirzebruch
              , Chapter 1, Section 4 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Neue topologische Methoden in der Algebraischen Geometrie
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.springer.com/de/book/9783662406052"} doi:10.1007/978-3-662-41083-7
          %p Classical textbook references are
          %ul
            %li#KobayashiNomizu63
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shoshichi+Kobayashi"}> Shoshichi Kobayashi
                ,
